{
  "id": "A36",
  "goal": "E2E",
  "title": "A member corrects or withdraws their own message in the room's discussion",
  "why": [
    "#365 section 4 (FND-C3a): a member could not take back or fix what they wrote in the room. Only the author may act on a message, an active member (a viewer too, on their own ordinary talk), never on another person's; no work grant comes with it.",
    "What a message is made of decides what it may do, from what its submit kept: a message written as text may be corrected (new words in a new source; same id, author and time; revision +1) or withdrawn, and either erases its old words with the running research and design that read them (research rebuilt on its goal and allowance). A message that shares a report or file can only be withdrawn, which leaves the source untouched. Identical words change nothing.",
    "Erasing is the member's decision on what it reaches: GET .../preview lists the running work the words reach and signs it (as previewMissionWithdrawal does, A08); the act carries that proof, the revision and the list it was shown, and is stale (409) when any has moved. Words a provider already received cannot be recalled.",
    "Old readers keep their shape: without revisions=1 the snapshot and discussion pages answer exactly as before, withdrawn messages left out and their current words in place of corrected ones. With revisions=1 entries carry revision, correctedAt and kind, and withdrawn messages come as tombstones (who and when, never words). A retry of a request whose words were erased is refused (request_erased), never answered with them."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ContributionActPreview",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What correcting or withdrawing the caller's own message would do, and the proof (15 minutes) the act must carry.",
        "properties": {
          "contributionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["correct", "withdraw"]
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "The message's revision; the act names it as expectedRevision."
          },
          "erases": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True for a message written as text: its current words are erased (a correction keeps the new ones). False for a message that shares a report or file, which stays as it is."
          },
          "reach": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Every running task that read the words and is revoked by erasing them, in task order, none left out. Words a provider already received cannot be recalled.",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["taskId", "kind", "restarts"],
              "properties": {
                "taskId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["research", "design"]
                },
                "restarts": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "Research whose goal still works starts again without the words, on the same allowance (or waits for Resume while held)."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "previewToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^v2\\.[0-9]{1,12}\\.[0-9a-f]{64}$",
            "description": "The preview's proof (v2): it binds the revision and the reach as shown. Another version's is refused."
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": ["contributionId", "action", "revision", "erases", "reach", "previewToken", "expiresAt"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ContributionCorrection",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "New words for the caller's own written message. Words identical to the current ones change nothing.",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4000
          },
          "expectedRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "reach": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["taskId", "kind", "restarts"],
              "properties": {
                "taskId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["research", "design"]
                },
                "restarts": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "Research whose goal still works starts again without the words, on the same allowance (or waits for Resume while held)."
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The reach exactly as the preview listed it, every task with its kind and restart (Codex on #396). Not bounded: the preview lists every task the words reach. An altered list fails the proof (422); one that is no longer true, as after a Stop or a Resume, is stale (409)."
          },
          "previewToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^v2\\.[0-9]{1,12}\\.[0-9a-f]{64}$",
            "description": "The preview's proof (v2): it binds the revision and the reach as shown. Another version's is refused."
          }
        },
        "required": ["text", "expectedRevision", "reach", "previewToken"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ContributionWithdrawal",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Take the caller's own message out of the discussion.",
        "properties": {
          "expectedRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "reach": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["taskId", "kind", "restarts"],
              "properties": {
                "taskId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["research", "design"]
                },
                "restarts": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "Research whose goal still works starts again without the words, on the same allowance (or waits for Resume while held)."
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The reach exactly as the preview listed it, every task with its kind and restart (Codex on #396). Not bounded: the preview lists every task the words reach. An altered list fails the proof (422); one that is no longer true, as after a Stop or a Resume, is stale (409)."
          },
          "previewToken": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^v2\\.[0-9]{1,12}\\.[0-9a-f]{64}$",
            "description": "The preview's proof (v2): it binds the revision and the reach as shown. Another version's is refused."
          }
        },
        "required": ["expectedRevision", "reach", "previewToken"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ContributionActReceipt",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A correction or withdrawal: no text and no digest.",
        "properties": {
          "contributionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "projectId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "operation": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["correct", "withdraw"]
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["current", "withdrawn"]
          },
          "changed": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "False for a correction with the words the message already has."
          },
          "cursor": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "The event the act emitted; null when it changed nothing."
          }
        },
        "required": ["contributionId", "projectId", "operation", "revision", "state", "changed", "cursor"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/WithdrawnEntry",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Where a withdrawn message stood (revisions=1 only): who and when, never its words.",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "actorId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "authorName": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 320
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "withdrawnAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": ["id", "actorId", "authorName", "createdAt", "withdrawnAt"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/DiscussionEntry/properties/revision",
      "value": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "description": "revisions=1 only: moves with each correction."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/DiscussionEntry/properties/correctedAt",
      "value": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "description": "revisions=1 only: when its words were last corrected; null if never."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/DiscussionEntry/properties/kind",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["text", "reference"],
        "description": "revisions=1 only: written as text (its author may correct it), or sharing a report or file (it can only be withdrawn)."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/DiscussionPage/properties/withdrawn",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 50,
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WithdrawnEntry"
        },
        "description": "revisions=1 only: the messages withdrawn within the page's span; the page's 50 counts them."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/Snapshot/properties/discussionWithdrawn",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 50,
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WithdrawnEntry"
        },
        "description": "revisions=1 only: the messages withdrawn within the discussion's span; its 50 counts them."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1snapshot/get/parameters/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "revisions",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["1"]
        },
        "description": "1: the reader handles corrections and withdrawals (A36): entries carry revision, correctedAt and kind, and withdrawn messages come as tombstones. Without it the answer is the shape before A36, withdrawn messages left out."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1discussion/get/parameters/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "revisions",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["1"]
        },
        "description": "1: the reader handles corrections and withdrawals (A36): entries carry revision, correctedAt and kind, and withdrawn messages come as tombstones. Without it the answer is the shape before A36, withdrawn messages left out."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1contributions~1{contributionId}~1preview",
      "value": {
        "get": {
          "operationId": "previewContributionAct",
          "summary": "What correcting or withdrawing the caller's own message would do, with the proof the act carries.",
          "tags": ["conversations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "contributionId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "action",
              "in": "query",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["correct", "withdraw"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "The preview",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContributionActPreview"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not an active member, or not the message's author",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "409": {
              "description": "stale_revision: the message was withdrawn",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Request fails the declared schema; the message is not in the discussion; a correction of a message that shares a report or file",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1contributions~1{contributionId}~1correction",
      "value": {
        "post": {
          "operationId": "correctContribution",
          "summary": "The author's new words for their own written message: same message, author and time; the old words erased with the work that read them.",
          "tags": ["conversations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "contributionId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "in": "header",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 160
              }
            }
          ],
          "requestBody": {
            "required": true,
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContributionCorrection"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Corrected, or nothing to change",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContributionActReceipt"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not an active member, or not the message's author",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "409": {
              "description": "stale_revision: the message, its reach or the preview changed or expired since it was shown, or it was withdrawn; request_erased: a retry of a correction whose words have since been erased; idempotency_conflict: the key was used for another request",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Request fails the declared schema; the message is not in the discussion; a proof not shown to this member for this message; a correction of a message that shares a report or file",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "description": "Dependent service unavailable",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1contributions~1{contributionId}~1withdrawal",
      "value": {
        "post": {
          "operationId": "withdrawContribution",
          "summary": "The author takes their own message out of the discussion: written words erased with the work that read them; a shared report or file untouched.",
          "tags": ["conversations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "contributionId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "in": "header",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 160
              }
            }
          ],
          "requestBody": {
            "required": true,
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContributionWithdrawal"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Withdrawn",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContributionActReceipt"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not an active member, or not the message's author",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "409": {
              "description": "stale_revision: the message, its reach or the preview changed or expired since it was shown, or it was withdrawn; request_erased: a retry of a correction whose words have since been erased; idempotency_conflict: the key was used for another request",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Request fails the declared schema; the message is not in the discussion; a proof not shown to this member for this message; a correction of a message that shares a report or file",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "description": "Dependent service unavailable",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
